#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:2
msgid "Install the Mattermost desktop app"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:7
msgid ""
"Download and install the Mattermost desktop app `for macOS from the App "
"Store <https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mattermost-"
"desktop/id1614666244?mt=12>`_, `for Windows from the Microsoft Store "
"<https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/xp8br8mh3lpklt?hl=en-US&gl=US>`_, or "
"by :doc:`using a package manager (Linux) </deployment-guide/desktop"
"/linux-desktop-install>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:9
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend installing the desktop app on a local drive. "
"Network shares aren't supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:11
msgid ""
"When prompted, enter the Mattermost server link and a display name for "
"the Mattermost instance. The display name is helpful in cases where you "
"connect to multiple Mattermost instances. See the :doc:`server "
"connections </end-user-guide/preferences/connect-multiple-workspaces>` "
"documentation for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:12
msgid "Enter your user credentials to log into Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:13
msgid ""
"The team that displays first in the team sidebar opens. If you're not a "
"member of a team yet, you're prompted to select a team to join."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:17
msgid ""
"When you log into Mattermost using external user credentials, such as "
"Google or Entra ID, you'll temporarily leave the desktop app during login"
" while authenticating your credentials. Once you're successfully logged "
"in to Mattermost, you'll be returned to the desktop app. See the `Single "
"Sign-On (SSO) <#single-sign-on-sso>`__ section below for details on the "
"external providers that Mattermosts supports."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:20
msgid "Upgrade the desktop app"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:22
msgid ""
"From v6.1.0, Mattermost Desktop uses in-app notifications to alert you "
"when new releases are available. You'll see a notification in the "
"**Downloads** dropdown with platform-specific options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:24
msgid ""
"**macOS (App Store)**: Select **Open Mac App Store** to update through "
"the App Store."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:25
msgid ""
"**macOS (DMG)**: Select **Download Update** to download the new DMG file "
"from your browser. Open the DMG and drag Mattermost to your Applications "
"folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Windows (Microsoft Store)**: Select **Use Windows Store** to update "
"through the Microsoft Store."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Windows (MSI)**: Select **Download Manually** to download the MSI "
"installer from your browser, then run the installer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Linux**: Select the notification to open the GitHub releases page, "
"download the appropriate package for your system (AppImage, deb, rpm, "
"Flatpak), and install it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:30
msgid "**Manual update check**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:32
msgid "You can manually check for updates at any time by:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:34
msgid "Selecting **Help > Check for Updates** from the menu bar, or"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:35
msgid "Going to **Settings > Updates** and selecting **Check Now**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:37
msgid "**Skip a version**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:39
msgid ""
"If you don't want to see notifications for a specific version, select "
"**Skip This Version** in the notification. You won't see notifications "
"for that version, but you'll be notified when a newer version is "
"released."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:43
msgid ""
"In enterprise deployments, your system administrator may disable update "
"notifications via Group Policy. If you're not seeing update "
"notifications, contact your IT department."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:46
msgid "Upgrading to v6.1.0 using Windows MSI installer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:48
msgid ""
"If you're upgrading from a version earlier than v6.1.0 using the Windows "
"MSI installer, you may need to recreate your taskbar shortcut once after "
"upgrading. This one-time change improves shortcut reliability and "
"prevents shortcuts from breaking during future upgrades."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:50
msgid ""
"Prior to v6.1.0, installing over an older Desktop App version could break"
" shortcuts. The v6.1.0 MSI installer uses a more reliable method for "
"shortcut icons that prevents this issue in future upgrades. This only "
"affects Windows MSI installer upgrades. The Windows Store version is not "
"affected, and future upgrades to v6.1.1 and later won't require shortcut "
"recreation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:52
msgid ""
"If your taskbar shortcut shows the wrong icon or fails to launch after "
"upgrading to v6.1.0:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:54
msgid ""
"Right-click the broken shortcut on your taskbar and select **Unpin from "
"taskbar**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:55
msgid "Launch Mattermost Desktop from the Start Menu or desktop shortcut."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:56
msgid "Right-click the Mattermost icon in the taskbar while it's running."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:57
msgid "Select **Pin to taskbar**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-desktop-app.rst:59
msgid "Your new shortcut will work correctly for all future updates."
msgstr ""

